Source directory: comfyui/moss-image/

vendor/loaders.py, vendor/model.py and vendor/text_encoder.py are unchanged
copies of that revision, licensed under Apache-2.0 (vendor/LICENSE).
The LDS entry point and weight adapter are separate from the upstream code.
Only the diffusion and text loaders are exposed; the HF directory loaders are
not included. The adapter losslessly splits Comfy-Org BF16 fused QKV matrices
into the separate projections used by this runtime. Quantized diffusion
weights are not supported by this adapter. The text encoder can use INT8.
